{"name":"factions_autonz","seed":65,"config":{"rivalsByCount":true}}
# New Expedition seed 65 with Rival factions 4 (the count that brings the
# autonz in): the autonz arrive at their landfall on the rim of the
# pregenerated galaxy, Gaunt Cradle (sys_46), and set up a hub there. 81 days
# pass (debug days): it converts its ground (about a third converted). Select
# its row (an unidentified system until the ship is there) and jump there
# (Travel Here; it lies inside the 200 starting fuel): from orbit the
# presence is seen, drawn on the
# Star Map as a blue chip with a pip beside the site, tagged AUTONZ HUB and
# noted [autonz hub] in Destinations. Beam one colonist down and land: the
# hub stamp (a round wired hall with a red-wired signal core), blue wire laid
# around it by its converted share, the fabricator and its locker, wire
# placers and enforcers at work. Let the director lay wire a while, then
# frame the hub and look.
